{
  "_form": "जाति प्रमाण पत्र हेतु आवेदन पत्र (अन्य पिछडा वर्ग/विशेष पिछडा वर्ग) — परिशिष्ट-ध, Rajasthan eMitra",
  "_source": "https://emitraapp.rajasthan.gov.in/emitrashared/USER_MGMT_DOCS/GUIDELINE_AND_EFORM/2019/7/30/GAndE_1564475156407.pdf, 276286 bytes",
  "_notes": [
    "The OBC/SBC form in the same series as caste-scst-slots-spec.json. Read",
    "that one first — the parse settings, the tick habit and the reason both are",
    "needed are all explained there. Same ink=rects, same widest=500.",
    "",
    "Legal size, 4 pages, where the SC/ST form is A4 with 3. Pages 1 and 4 are",
    "the citizen's. Pages 2 and 3 are BOTH witness attestations, and they are",
    "not alternatives to skip past: section 4 is for an applicant who has an ITR",
    "or a government pay slip to show, section 6 for one who has neither.",
    "",
    "Where it differs from SC/ST, and it is not a cosmetic difference:",
    "  * Its जाति box is genuinely blank. On the SC/ST form that box is",
    "    pre-printed with the category, so this one has to be written.",
    "  * Item 8 asks the caste's serial number in the state OBC list, not the",
    "    father's religion. There is no father's religion/caste/sub-caste here,",
    "    and no question about the caste recorded in education records.",
    "  * It has one Yes/No row with two cells where SC/ST has two rows of one.",
    "",
    "The 5x4 table (rows 17-21) is the creamy-layer declaration: the mother's,",
    "father's and husband's organisation, post and pay scale, plus immovable",
    "property. Row 17 is the printed header (विवरण/माता/पिता/पति) and is not",
    "mapped. The 12 data cells are, and are left blank on purpose — asking a",
    "citizen by voice for three relatives' employers, posts and pay scales is a",
    "large number of questions, and this table is the basis of non-creamy-layer",
    "eligibility, so a wrong answer is worse than a blank one. Same call as the",
    "PMUY household table. Clauses (3) and (4) of the affidavit ask for the",
    "parents' post and annual income and are left blank for the same reason.",
    "",
    "Section 3 (मृत्यु/स्थाई अक्षमता) prints 'यदि लागू नहीं हो तो छोड दीजिये' —",
    "leave it out if it does not apply. Its date and details are mapped so the",
    "checker accounts for them, and left blank.",
    "",
    "Three date guides here, not two: item 5's date of birth, section 3's",
    "death/disability date, and the declaration date. The last of these is why",
    "row 27 exists — the स्थान box is drawn TWICE, two rectangles a point apart.",
    "Row 26 is the one used; row 27 is the duplicate and is not mapped. The",
    "General-category blank has the same doubled box; the SC/ST one does not."
  ],
